        security: "Cost anomaly alerts can reveal abuse of upload endpoints; authenticate uploads, limit file sizes and page counts, and scan files before processing.",
        checklist: ['Peak load estimated in pages per hour', 'Load test for seconds per document and limits', 'Concurrency capped below service limits', 'Queue-driven autoscaling', 'Classify first; cheapest sufficient model', 'Add-ons only where needed', 'Dashboards joining pipeline and business metrics'],
